  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As there are more players joining VRChat, which also brought into more challenges to world moderation. \nCanny isn't bad itself, but in reality there are no spotlights for world creator true concerns getting onto the table and truly implement the features and patches so far.\nSeeing posts that uphold for a year long, and there are hundreds of voted up still getting no practical moves on it which is poor, as we all creators just want to make VRChat a better and safer place for all.\n I think most creator agrees and we love VRChat keep improving in a way people keep coming in and have a great time out of it.\nTherefore, I suggest a periodic World Creators and VRChat Devs meet-up, or even a forum face to face.  Instead of just posting updates whenever theres' one, a real time communication is far better than just text messages.",
